the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move a with *an index* is made; known as a.
    the move b with *an index* is made; known as b.
    the move c with *an index* is made; known as c.

the fluents are:
    control *a thing*; known as control.
    *an index* is a p; known as p.
    *an index* is a q; known as q.
    *an index* is a r; known as r.
    *a thing* is a step; known as step_1.
    *an index* is the step of *a thing*; known as step_2.
    *a thing* is a done; known as done.
    *a thing* is an over; known as over.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *an index* is an index.
    the move a with *an index* is legal.
    the move b with *an index* is legal.
    the move c with *an index* is legal.
    the successor of *a thing* is *a second thing*.

the knowledge base bestbuttonsandlights includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/bestbuttonsandlights.hrf".

1 is an index.

2 is an index.

3 is an index.

4 is an index.

5 is an index.

6 is an index.

7 is an index.

8 is an index.

9 is an index.

the move a with an index is legal if
    the index is an index.

the move b with an index is legal if
    the index is an index.

the move c with an index is legal if
    the index is an index.

the successor of 1 is 2.

the successor of 2 is 3.

the successor of 3 is 4.

the successor of 4 is 5.

the successor of 5 is 6.

the successor of 6 is 7.

the goal of robot is 100 at a time if
    a thing is a done at the time.

a thing is a done at a time if
    the thing is a p at the time
    and the thing is a q at the time
    and the thing is a r at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    a thing is an over at the time.

a thing is an over at a time if
    the thing is a done at the time.

a thing is an over at a time if
    the thing is the step of 7 at the time.

when the move a with an index is made
    and it is not the case that the index is a p
then the index is a p.

when the move a with an index is made
    and the index is a p
then it is not the case that the index is a p.

when the move a with an index is made
    and the index is the step of a thing
    and the successor of the thing is a second thing
then the index is the step of the second thing
    and it is not the case that the index is the step of the thing.

when the move b with an index is made
    and the index is a q
then the index is a p.

when the move b with an index is made
    and it is not the case that the index is a q
then it is not the case that the index is a p.

when the move b with an index is made
    and the index is a p
then the index is a q.

when the move b with an index is made
    and it is not the case that the index is a p
then it is not the case that the index is a q.

when the move b with an index is made
    and a thing is a step
    and the successor of the thing is a second thing
then the index is the step of the second thing
    and it is not the case that the index is the step of the thing.

when the move c with an index is made
    and the index is a q
then the index is a r.

when the move c with an index is made
    and it is not the case that the index is a q
then it is not the case that the index is a r.

when the move c with an index is made
    and the index is a r
then the index is a q.

when the move c with an index is made
    and it is not the case that the index is a r
then it is not the case that the index is a q.

when the move c with an index is made
    and the index is the step of a thing
    and the successor of the thing is a second thing
then the index is the step of the second thing
    and it is not the case that the index is the step of the thing.

initially 1 is the step of 1
    and 2 is the step of 1
    and 3 is the step of 1
    and 4 is the step of 1
    and 5 is the step of 1
    and 6 is the step of 1
    and 7 is the step of 1
    and 8 is the step of 1
    and 9 is the step of 1
    and control robot.

